- **Kernel facts.** Termination is horizon-only: `previous_step >= episodeSteps − 2` (`engine_rs/src/lib.rs:1487`), so the default game ends at transition 719, and `episodeSteps` 1 and 2 end after one transition. `step_with_market_metrics` already clones and commits only on success (:1431–1449), so the baseline really is two clones plus one snapshot. `econ_counters()` is public (:1370) and S/D/I are indices 0/1/2 (:1120–1122).
